# Tizimga kirganda berilgan Bearer Tokenni shu yerga
@authToken = SIZNING_ACCESS_TOKENINGIZ

# Test qilinadigan Bemor ID si (Bazadan oling)
@patientId = a1b2c3d4-1234-5678-90ab-cdef12345678

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1-QADAM: QR KOD RASMINI YARATISH (Bemor ilovada ko'radi)
# -------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Bu so'rov orqali:
# 1. Tizim bemorga yangi 'qrToken' generatsiya qiladi (agar yo'q bo'lsa).
# 2. Javob sifatida PNG rasm qaytadi.
# 3. Siz bu rasmni ko'z bilan ko'rasiz, lekin token ichida yashiringan bo'ladi.
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/patient/qr/{{patientId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: image/png

# >>>> MUHIM QADAM <<<<
# Yuqoridagi so'rov ishligandan so'ng, BAZAGA KIRING ("patient_profile" jadvali)
# va o'sha bemorning "qr_token" ustunidagi qiymatni nusxalab oling.
# Masalan: XyZ123

# -------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2-QADAM: SHIFOKOR SIFATIDA MA'LUMOTNI O'QISH (Public API)
# -------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Bu yerga bazadan olgan tokenni qo'ying
@qrToken = XyZ123

### Bu so'rovda Authorization (Token) SHART EMAS!
# Chunki shifokor login qilmaydi.
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/public/qr/info/{{qrToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### KUTILAYOTGAN NATIJA (JSON):
